5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like to live next to these things! I'll check the station block's bin house and the next lane's mornings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,It's important we all feel comfortable with the cost. I'll look into the ward subsidy and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We should probably see why people are complaining. I'll check the ward complaint log and the station block's meeting minutes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm worried about the workload. I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the truck arrival time from the crew leader.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to ensure the burden is distributed fairly. I will check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
