29,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house at the station block smells really bad in summer! I don't think a permanent box is a good idea.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Midori,,"A shelter is quite expensive, even with the subsidy. We're already spending over thirty thousand yen a year just on maintenance for the open point.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,It seems the person living right next to the bins is the one suffering most. Most complaints come from that one house.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,Supervised mornings take about fifty minutes. But the truck comes so early that some of us would have to be up before dawn to manage it.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Not all our frontages are equal. Some are too narrow or have driveways, so moving the point around might not be physically possible for everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, is fifty minutes a long time? I think it's better than a smelly box!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, if we can't move it, maybe we should focus on how to make the current spot better without spending too much.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, ""better"" is subjective. If we just build a box, we might end up fighting over who cleans it, like the station block did.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"It's not just the fifty minutes, Rin; it's the early wake-up call. That's a lot of effort for a ""simple"" fix.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"Exactly. And the ward requires a new notice every time we change the site, making a rotation a bureaucratic nightmare.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,"But if we just leave it, the person next to it is sad! We have to change something.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. We need a balance between the cost, the effort, and the fairness to our neighbors.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we want to keep the peace, we should avoid options that create new chores or permanent disputes over maintenance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm not keen on being a morning warden, but I'm also not keen on a project that takes four months of paperwork.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Given the frontage constraints and the filing rules, a rotating location seems impractical.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Rin,,I vote for something that isn't a smelly box!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Midori,,Let's see the options and decide which one is most sustainable for everyone's budget and schedule.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,As long as we don't pick something that makes us hate each other in two years.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,May,,I just want to make sure we aren't signing up for a second job as bin police.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We must prioritize a solution that is logically feasible and doesn't unfairly burden one household.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
